            q: 'What is DekolonizArt?',
            a: 'DekolonizArt is an independent multidisciplinary performing arts company based in Berlin, Germany. Through theatre, dance, music, film, storytelling, and visual arts, we revisit history from African perspectives and create artistic experiences that inspire dialogue, remembrance, and renewal.'
